s, rising to incredible heights, are dotted with the entrances of numerous caves, some small and mysterious, others large enough to suggest deeper, hidden chambers. The rock walls are alive with texture—cascading vines, moss, and sparkling veins of quartz and minerals catch the sunlight in dazzling patterns.\n\nWaterfalls tumble from the walls high above, pouring into the lake below with a continuous roar, their mist spreading across the cavern and catching the sunlight to create shimmering rainbows. Gigantic stalactites hang from the cavern ceiling, some so massive they resemble natural pillars, while others remain suspended above, creating dramatic shapes against the light.\n\nThe opening at the top dominates the scene, revealing a bright, clear blue sky framed by the greenery of the jungle. Birds with vibrant plumage glide across the open space, their cries echoing faintly. The sunlight streaming down illuminates the lake, the patches of land, and the cavern walls, creating a breathtaking interplay of light and shadow.\n\nThis colossal cenote, with its immense opening and the intricate blend of water, land, and caves, feels like a hidden world on an unimaginable scale, combining vibrant life, geological wonder, and a sense of serene majesty."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 1039, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 1000, "label": "text", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {"pinned": false, "collapsed": false}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": {"0": 474.760986328125, "1": 59.253170013427734}, "pos": [-3733.19580078125, 1766.4014892578125], "id": 98, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 18}, {"outputs": [{"name": "GUIDER", "slot_index": 0, "links": [916], "label": "GUIDER", "type": "GUIDER"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": [3], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 912, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL"}, {"name": "positive", "link": 913, "label": "posit